Object.assign(I18N_EN, {"樓梯頂道門開住——趁太太喺下面，可以爬樓梯溜出去": "The door at the top of the stairs is open — while she's down here, climb the stairs and slip out", "捉實衣架！按「跳」可以中途鬆手": "Hold on to the hanger! Press Jump to let go on the way", "捉實衣架！撳 Space 可以中途鬆手": "Hold on to the hanger! Press Space to let go on the way", "儲物房：呢度冇人望到你，整出聲都冇人聽到。架上啲嘢拎得，拎完過一陣會補返": "The storeroom: nobody can see you in here, and nobody hears a thing. Take what's on the shelves — it comes back after a while", "由後面條走廊都入到客廳！遙控器應該喺沙發前面嘅咖啡枱。": "The back hallway gets you into the living room too! The remote should be on the coffee table by the sofa.", "滑緊……按「跳」可以中途鬆手": "Sliding… press Jump to let go", "滑緊……撳 Space 可以中途鬆手": "Sliding… press Space to let go", "按「用」捉住衣架，沿晾衫繩滑去走廊尾": "Press Use to grab the hanger and slide down the clothesline to the end of the hallway", "撳 E 捉住衣架，沿晾衫繩滑去走廊尾": "Press E to grab the hanger and slide down the clothesline to the end of the hallway", "爬上報紙、鞋櫃同鞋盒，捉住頂嗰個衣架就可以滑過成條走廊": "Climb the newspapers, the shoe cabinet and the shoe boxes — grab the hanger at the top and slide the whole hallway", "牆腳個窿通去廚房櫃底——一出去就係太太腳邊，小心": "The hole at the foot of the wall comes out under the kitchen counter — right by her feet. Careful", "櫃底條窿通去後面嘅儲物房（嗰度冇人望到你）": "The gap under the cabinet leads to the storeroom behind (nobody can see you in there)", "提子乾": "Raisin", "食咗：體力回返一半": "Eat it: half your stamina back", "波子": "Marble", "掟出去：落地之後會一路碌、一路響，引人行遠啲": "Throw it: it keeps rolling and ticking along the floor, leading people further away", "食咗粒提子乾——體力回返一半": "Ate a raisin — half your stamina back", "出咗地庫門！呢度係屋後走廊——太太返咗上廚房煮飯，唔會再落地庫": "Out through the basement door! This is the back hallway — she's gone back up to cook, and won't come down to the basement again", "（牆入面有把聲）……教授？係你？放喺洞口就得，我幫你睇住佢。": "(A voice from inside the wall) …Professor? Is that you? Leave it by the hole — I'll keep an eye on it."});
